{'symbol': 'A', 'date': '2022-10-11 02:00:00', 'title': 'WORLD ECONOMIC FORUM RECOGNIZES AGILENT FACILITY IN SINGAPORE AS A LEADER IN ADVANCED MANUFACTURING', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AGILENT TECHNOLOGIES INC. (NYSE: A) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE WORLD ECONOMIC FORUM'S GLOBAL LIGHTHOUSE NETWORK HAS NAMED AGILENT'S FACILITY IN SINGAPORE A FOURTH INDUSTRIAL REVOLUTION (4IR) LEADER FOR EFFECTIVELY DEPLOYING INNOVATIVE TECHNOLOGIES AT SCALE IN THE MANUFACTURE OF SCIENTIFIC INSTRUMENTS. “BECAUSE OF THE INCREDIBLE WORK OF OUR TEAM IN SINGAPORE, AGILENT IS AMONG THE LEADING MANUFACTURERS IN OUR SECTOR,” SAID MIKE MCMULLEN, PRESIDENT AND CEO OF AGILENT"}